/**
 * reworkLoopGuard.js — the rework no-op loop guard (gh-957), pure side.
 *
 * Live pathology (dart PR #424, 2026-10-17 08:00–10:55Z): the SM armed
 * agent:rework on unresolved review threads 7 times in 2 hours; every leg
