    // gh-957 (epam/dmtools-agents 2026-10-17): the threads-rule arm re-armed
    // a dev leg that ran a no-op rework sweep — the leg saw 2 review threads
    // while the sweep's GraphQL reviewThreads inventory counted 64 (the
